Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.90,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fad(0,438)\fs15\3a&H20&\bord1.5\blur1.5\fscx78\pos(479,218)}of the {\c&H7A4AE4&}Reincarnated Princess {\c&H140900&}and the {\c&HE38B59&}Genius Young Lady
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:08.52,Flashback,Young Algard,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:12.81,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,I came over to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:15.75,Flashback,Young Algard,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:17.16,Flashback,Young Algard,0,0,0,,You're gonna get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:18.64,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,It'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:20.62,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's do some experiments!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:26.20,Flashback,Young Algard,0,0,0,,Are you sure it'll be all right this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:29.03,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,O-Of course! My theory's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:30.35,Flashback,Young Algard,0,0,0,,Is it really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.21,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:34.92,Flashback,Young Algard,0,0,0,,You said that last time, \Nand then there was a huge explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.92,0:00:37.35,Flashback,Young Algard,0,0,0,,Even I got in trouble with Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:40.15,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,We'll be okay this time! \NIt'll work for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.15,0:00:43.36,Flashback,Young Algard,0,0,0,,No. I'm not hanging out with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:45.56,Flashback,Young Algard,0,0,0,,You don't even feel bad about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:49.76,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.77,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,What happened last time \Nwas my fault! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:56.07,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.09,0:01:01.99,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,Let's shake hands and make up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:11.72,Flashback,Young Algard,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I can play along \Nwith you for a {\i1}little{\i0} bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:13.67,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yeah! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:19.17,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,Let's go, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:32.02,DefaultItalics,Algard,0,0,0,,I still remember how warm her hand felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:34.97,DefaultItalics,Algard,0,0,0,,Which is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:37.60,DefaultItalics,Algard,0,0,0,,I still can't forget how cold it felt
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:40.67,DefaultItalics,Algard,0,0,0,,when our hands separated, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.91,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Water Cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:01.08,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Water Lance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.15,0:02:08.93,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Icicle Prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:22.59,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Water Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:38.85,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:44.67,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You're not afraid at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:47.55,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You need to stop taking me so lightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.31,0:02:51.32,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,The super-regeneration of a vampire...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:53.03,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That's gonna be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:02:55.69,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Water Bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:00.74,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:12.92,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I know your Mana Blade is weak \Nagainst physical attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.91,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,And you think that gives you \Na strategy against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.91,0:03:18.26,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,If you do, you didn't think \Nthis through very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:21.71,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Well, let's just find out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:24.63,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,if that's true or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:30.28,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Icicle Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:55.55,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I fear for our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:58.24,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,How ironic it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:04:00.68,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,No matter how strong you \Ndemonstrate yourself to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:02.91,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,you will only be feared by the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:06.39,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You'll be called a heretic, \Nand no one will recognize your worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.99,0:04:08.89,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Which one of us is the heretic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.11,0:04:13.89,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I know better than anyone \Nthat I'm a heretic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:19.13,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You know it yourself, and yet \Nyou make no effort to change?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:23.44,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,What was it you hoped to accomplish, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:27.01,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,What did you hope to become?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.01,0:04:30.28,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:34.45,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Answer me, Anisphia Wynn Palettia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:38.92,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm just me. I can't become anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:41.64,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I just had a love for magic, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.89,0:04:46.01,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Even after all this, you're still \Nhiding behind stupid word games?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.59,0:04:48.23,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You'll just pretend to accept it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:51.80,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,while you keep lying to yourself \Nand deceiving those around you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:58.76,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You aren't fit for this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:03.54,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:08.07,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,But even if I can't use magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:09.94,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I know it's still a sacred thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:13.09,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I still have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.09,0:05:15.35,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I believe in magic, and I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.35,0:05:16.83,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I always will!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:19.92,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,And that's more than enough \Nto make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.87,0:05:27.11,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Even knowing the thing you \Nlove will always betray you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.01,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,you'd still say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:33.56,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You truly are arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:39.55,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I will surpass you. I {\i1}have{\i0} to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:42.53,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I can't move forward if I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:51.69,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Anisphia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:01.58,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,Eu...phylli...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:03.00,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Please, don't speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.29,0:06:07.00,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,I... know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:10.79,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,I should... give up...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:15.36,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,There's nothing... I can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:19.68,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,except scream... the way I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:21.55,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Scream?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.55,0:06:23.12,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,Lady Euphyllia...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.37,0:06:27.42,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,If I had blood... magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:29.17,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You need blood?! I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:31.13,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:33.79,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Stay as you are, Lady Euphyllia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:35.12,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,I will—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:43.09,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:11.89,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,No... The pain won't go away...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:16.30,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,How is Prince Algard able to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:18.20,DefaultTop,Lainie,0,0,0,,It hurts! It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:20.40,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Even after regenerating, \Nyou still feel pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:50.22,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Lady Euphyllia...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:53.77,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Do you not wish to put a stop to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.94,0:07:58.11,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:03.20,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.39,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I broke it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:13.17,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I smashed the damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:19.01,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Is this the best you can do, Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:23.58,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around! Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:27.39,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Am I not even worth existing \Nin your field of vision?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:31.06,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.95,0:08:36.11,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You're saying I should \Nfight to kill, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:42.65,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Aerial Attack: Dragon Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.41,0:08:47.62,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You're such...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:53.22,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,a stupid little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.32,0:09:22.17,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Not yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:28.93,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:43.68,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:46.92,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.21,0:09:53.29,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:59.04,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:14.08,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:20.59,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,What good does it do for you two \Nto try to kill each other?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:22.55,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You're both idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:26.96,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You don't want to fight if it means \Nhaving to make that face, do you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:29.32,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You didn't want to kill him, did you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:33.19,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Yet you kept fighting... \Nhurting each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:35.89,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Are you a complete fool?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:48.31,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:51.80,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,It was nice weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.14,0:10:56.59,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,The skies were clear, so I was looking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:11:01.41,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,There's only one person I know \Nwho'd be up in the sky like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.43,0:11:09.11,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Do you remember, Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:13.68,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,The day we escaped the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:15.26,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:18.91,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Then we were attacked by a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:23.91,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You stayed behind so I \Ncould escape, and I ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:26.96,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I hid so it wouldn't find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:28.95,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I just trembled in fear \Nand didn't even breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:34.98,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,And you were the one who found me then, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.83,0:11:40.72,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You were always leading me by the hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:44.85,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You taught me so many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:46.56,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I really think
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.55,0:11:50.20,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I was still human right up until that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:53.69,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Until the day you pushed me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.65,0:11:59.74,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's true. I pushed Al away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:02.23,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,After that monster attacked us,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:04.69,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,a rumor started going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:11.85,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,A rumor that I had tried \Nto kill Al out of jealousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:16.97,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That's why I renounced \Nmy right to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:19.67,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I wanted to prove that I had no interest
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.31,0:12:23.05,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,in inheriting the throne, \Nand no ill intent toward Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.71,0:12:29.17,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,Sorry about everything. \NYou can be the next king now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:30.45,Flashback,Young Anisphia,0,0,0,,So don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.89,0:12:44.41,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That was the day...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:48.47,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,our relationship changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:52.90,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Hey, Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:56.34,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Why did you throw away \Nyour right to the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:13:00.69,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Why must someone who's \Nso much smarter than me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:03.17,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,who can show concern for others,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.17,0:13:06.04,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,be scorned as unworthy of the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:07.90,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.23,0:13:09.51,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:13.36,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,But still, you should be queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.79,0:13:15.93,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,At least, I felt that way sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:23.38,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,But the people who run this \Nkingdom will never let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:26.77,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,A country that denies someone's superiority
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.77,0:13:29.28,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,and only adheres to old traditions
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:32.72,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,may have a glorious past, \Nbut it'll never have a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:34.12,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.99,0:13:37.83,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,What choice is there \Nbut to destroy it and start over?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:39.50,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:43.61,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,It'll never be within my reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.75,0:13:49.52,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,The true genius, the one who \Ntruly cares for the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:51.92,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,the one capable of earning \Nthe proper qualifications...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:53.74,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:13:56.44,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.35,0:14:05.10,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I shouldn't even have been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:11.49,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Because of me, you had to get hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:14.60,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,And if it meant you had to be hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:17.80,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,if it meant you'd have to feel this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:21.69,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I never should have been born...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:28.21,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.17,0:14:36.20,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,It hurts being unable to become \Nwhat you truly want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:07.64,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Algard, why did you do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.16,0:15:10.29,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I have nothing to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:14.43,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,except that I was a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.11,0:15:20.44,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Then I have no choice but to disinherit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.07,0:15:25.62,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Do you resent me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:28.97,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,No. If I harbor any resentment,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:31.21,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,it's for this entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:36.97,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I hated everything, from the moment \NI was born up until this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:39.55,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Everything, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:42.15,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,That's quite the declaration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:46.70,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,No commutations or apologies are \Nneeded with regard to my punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:48.38,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I will comply with your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:56.84,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,You will hereby be exiled \Nto the borderlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:59.36,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Until your body is reduced to dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:02.67,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,it will be put to use in service \Nof this kingdom. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:08.08,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I offer my deepest gratitude for \NYour Majesty's great kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.41,0:16:11.43,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,"Your Majesty," eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:18.43,Default,Sylphine,0,0,0,,I've failed as a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:22.16,Default,Sylphine,0,0,0,,I know I had a part in \Nnurturing your resentment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:25.21,Default,Sylphine,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Algard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:29.11,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,My sin is my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:32.91,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Please, do not worry yourself over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:36.38,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I wasn't a better son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:50.33,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,Prince Algard,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:55.19,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,could you tell us about the others \Ninvolved in this incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.19,0:16:56.45,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:58.39,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,Then, if you would follow me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:08.29,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.57,0:17:19.90,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Do you... remember this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:31.51,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,"Shake hands and make up," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:40.81,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.82,0:17:45.28,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,If I had just lived a normal \Nlife in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.07,0:17:49.24,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,you wouldn't have suffered so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:51.85,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:56.80,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Thank you. And I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:09.30,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I couldn't protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:22.44,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,After Prince Algard's \Npunishment was decided,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:28.24,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,all the plans writhing behind the \Ncancellation of his engagement to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.24,0:18:30.18,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Euphyllia Magenta, came to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:35.77,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,It all started when Master Moritz, \Nafter learning who Lainie was,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.77,0:18:39.03,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,discovered some research \Nmaterials about vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.96,0:18:43.54,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,As punishment for using her vampire powers
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:48.12,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,and Prince Algard himself in a plot \Nto obtain even greater authority,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.12,0:18:50.61,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,the Chartreuse conspirators \Nwere granted death
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.61,0:18:52.93,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,for threatening the king's authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:57.58,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Those who worked with them \Nwere also severely punished,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:18:59.95,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,leaving the castle in chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:02.91,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,We were not unscathed, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:05.62,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Both Miss Anis and Ilia are bedridden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.34,0:19:08.57,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Only Lainie and I remain healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.16,0:19:12.24,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:17.33,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,the day of Prince Algard's departure \Nfor the borderlands arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:36.02,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to appear without notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:40.49,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Might I speak with Prince \NAlgard for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:42.05,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Er, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:49.66,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.10,0:19:51.87,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,Prince Algard...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.87,0:19:52.84,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Lainie...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.72,0:19:56.61,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,This was the only choice I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.61,0:19:58.60,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Feel free to curse me all you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.70,0:20:06.97,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,You did do a terrible thing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:08.60,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,But it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:13.80,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,I believe the Prince Algard \Nwho was kind to me is real, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:15.76,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Real?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:20.24,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,I know you only did all that \Nso you could use me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:23.77,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,But I felt happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.77,0:20:27.54,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,So I don't think that kindness was a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:33.00,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,But it still hurt very much, and I \Nsuffered a lot, so I won't forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:34.43,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,I'll despise you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:38.25,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll always remember, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:41.46,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,To be both apologetic and grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.25,0:20:50.89,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Euphyllia, I need to apologize to you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:53.56,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I know you probably don't believe that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:56.07,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,No, that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.07,0:20:58.08,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,It's fine. Don't put up a front.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.47,0:21:02.16,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Though I suppose, for you, \Nthat just came naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.97,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You're the duke's genius daughter, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:09.00,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,But you can't be someone's \Nfiancée like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:11.96,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,It's despicable. Not lovable at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:16.16,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,How very rude you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.95,0:21:18.29,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Prince Algard...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.29,0:21:20.73,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Please forgive this one act of indiscretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:24.39,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I've already been disinherited. \NDo whatever you want to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.95,0:21:33.36,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,That really stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:36.57,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,In truth, I considered \Nusing my fist instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:37.74,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,but I couldn't, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:42.08,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,That's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:45.44,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,There's no one who'd say you're \Nlike a little doll anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:49.75,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,No... If I could have faced \Nthe problem properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.75,0:21:51.78,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,perhaps I would have found another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:55.00,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I do apologize for falling short.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:22:00.43,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,That said, you were absolutely \Ndeplorable as a fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.77,0:22:05.64,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I'm impressed we both kept up that \Nhorrible engagement for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.82,0:22:11.95,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.39,0:22:15.77,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I had hoped to apologize to Ilia \Nin person, as well, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.31,0:22:18.24,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'll pass that along to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:26.40,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.73,0:22:30.46,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I know I'm really in no position \Nto ask this of you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.54,0:22:35.87,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Take care of my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.29,0:23:01.48,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,A reaction to the seal on your back, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.09,0:23:07.21,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I only helped you because \Nyou said it was safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.27,0:23:10.67,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:15.21,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Al... I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.89,0:23:20.22,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.01,0:23:22.71,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Have pleasant dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.64,0:23:28.04,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'll be here beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:34.97,Next Episode Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,114)}Episode Nine\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fs25}The Sister and Brother, and for \NWhom the Crown Is Intended
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:39.97,Next Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,114)}Episode Ten\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fs25}The Royal Succession of Resignation and Fury
